# Gambl Poker agent notes

## Product source
- Treat `poker-game-prd.md` as the source of truth for game modes and rules.
- Build menu and table UI mobile-first. At 320px wide, all player cards, all five community-card positions, chip stacks, pot, prompt, and action controls must remain visible without horizontal scrolling.
- Keep the visual language premium and casino-like: midnight blue, felt green, restrained gold, action red, and bright blue.

## Gameplay contract
- Hints are off by default.
- Keep the dealer question or decision prompt visible while players are answering.
- Preserve private CPU hole cards until showdown.
- Use a standard 52-card deck and compare the best five-card combination at showdown.
- Sound must be user-controlled and must never block gameplay.

## Quality checks
- Run `npm run build` and `npm test` before publishing.
- Test menu navigation, CPU difficulty selection, all four betting rounds, showdown, tutorial steps, and 320px mobile layout.
- Never describe room-code multiplayer as live until remote synchronization has been implemented and tested.

## Release targets
- Source repository: `git@github.com:workceostewart-lang/Gambl-Poker.git`
- Game domain: `https://gambl-poker.fantomzone.app`
- Add or retain a matching game card on the Fantom Zone homepage.
